": "Item Category and wholesale follow the sheet on existing items; retail never does because Sage owns it."}, {"id": "sites_ardmore_handover_2026_11_09_sage_cost_qty_0_then_adjustment", "label": "Sage cost rule: create with qty 0, then stock adjustment at sheet cost", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "sites/ardmore-handover-2026-11-09.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A create with qty above 0 makes Sage cost the stock from the selling price and Pharoh will not change that; the adjustment cost replaces Sage's average (sheet cost chosen over weighted average)."}, {"id": "sites_ardmore_handover_2026_11_09_till_tickets_shared_login", "label": "Till tickets: POS Profile.custom_till_login + 'Who is logging this?'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/ardmore-handover-2026-11-09.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tickets from a shared till login are raised with the chosen Sales Person's email so replies go to that rep only."}, {"id": "sites_ardmore_handover_2026_11_09_price_sync_adds_vat_twice_open_question", "label": "Open: price sync adds VAT twice? (get-additional-prices-for-erpnext x 1.15)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/ardmore-handover-2026-11-09.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On Sage TEST the list rate is already VAT-inclusive; if confirmed, every extra price list has been 15% high. Russell said no changes to the price sync, so ask first."}, {"id": "sites_ardmore_handover_2026_11_09_ceramics_aca_till_pricing_open", "label": "Open: Ceramics/ACA till pricing (Sage Item price vs wholesale default list)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "sites/ardmore-handover-2026-11-09.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contribut